<section class="relative py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="dossier-panel overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]">
        <div class="border-b border-hairline p-5 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:p-6">
          <p class="coord text-accent">03 / North star</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 md:p-7 lg:p-8">
          <p class="coord text-signal">Future pattern</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-5xl">
            Build the data product. Earn the creative freedom.
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] md:items-start">
            <div>
              <p class="section-copy text-base md:text-lg">
                The north star is not a job title. It is an arc: use domain knowledge to build a
                proprietary data product, turn that product into an industry-specific software
                company, and create enough ownership to choose the next creative chapter.
              </p>
              <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-base md:text-lg">
                Alex's version is still being built around franchise economics, parcel data,
                rail-served property, satellite signals, tax structure, and AI workflows. The
                important part is the pattern: maps, markets, and media can be one life architecture
                when the product layer is owned.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-quiet rounded-md p-5">
              <p class="coord text-accent">Pattern</p>
              <ol class="mt-5 space-y-4">
                {[
                  'Technical domain knowledge',
                  'Proprietary data product',
                  'Industry-specific software company',
                  'Capital outcome',
                  'Creative production',
                ].map((item, index) => (
                  <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.2rem_1fr] gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                    <span class="timeline-number self-start">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                    <span>{item}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3 border-t border-hairline pt-5">
            <a href="/finance" class="button-primary">Alex's version <span class="mono text-xs" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
            <a href="/work" class="button-secondary">Current builds <span class="mono text-xs" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
